    "body": "### Fixed\r\n\r\n- [`adr-template.md`](https://github.com/adr/madr/tree/4.0.0/template/adr-template.md): Re-add quotes around chosen option name.\r\n- [`adr-template-minimal.md`](https://github.com/adr/madr/tree/4.0.0/template/adr-template-minimal.md): Place holder in one line.\r\n- [`adr-template-bare.md`](https://github.com/adr/madr/tree/4.0.0/template/adr-template-bare.md): Keep fixed template text as normal markdown (and not as comment).\r\n- `adr-template-bare.md` and [`adr-template-bare-minimal.md`](https://github.com/adr/madr/tree/4.0.0/template/adr-template-bare-minimal.md): Always use `<!-- \u2026 ->` als place holder instead of `{\u2026}`.\r\n\r\nSee https://github.com/adr/madr/tree/4.0.0/template for the list of all templates."
